[gd_scene format=3]

; The Effigy, east of the Lode (map offset (559.5, -191)): an effigy of the makers, a colossus of stone standing astride
; the way to the Heart. A shrine and a scripture plate before it. The first law holds the pilgrim at its feet; the only
; way on is through it, between its legs, and pressing on breaks the law.

